# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Pages consumes this file and strips it from the deploy, so it is never served
# and never crawlable. Syntax: a path pattern at column 0, then indented
# `Name: value` lines. Comments must start at column 0 — an indented `#` is not
# documented as a comment, and a misparse here fails silently, costing every
# header below. That is why the notes are all up here and the block is bare.
#
# Pages already sends `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` and
# `Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin` on every response; they are
# deliberately not repeated below, to avoid duplicate headers.
#
# The CSP lists every source the pages actually use and nothing else, verified
# against the markup rather than copied from a template:
#
#   script-src  — /script.js, /legal-data.js, /vendor/marked.min.js. All
#                 same-origin, and no inline script remains in the repo
#                 (legal-data.html's block was moved into legal-data.js for
#                 exactly this reason), so no 'unsafe-inline' and no hash.
#   style-src   — /style.css only. No style="" attributes anywhere.
#   connect-src — the API for /v1/ready and /v1/rights, plus 'self' for the
#                 /LEGAL_DATA.md fetch that renders the governance page.
#                 REMEMBER: a new API host must be added here or fetch fails.
#   img-src     — nothing today; 'self' and data: are here so adding the
#                 og:image the homepage comment asks for doesn't need a policy
#                 change first.
#   form-action — 'none', and true: the demo is deliberately not a <form>.
#
# X-Frame-Options duplicates frame-ancestors for browsers old enough not to
# enforce CSP.
#
# HSTS is one year but deliberately WITHOUT includeSubDomains or preload. Both
# are effectively irreversible once a browser or the preload list has cached
# them, and includeSubDomains would bind api.rightsclock.eu and every future
# subdomain to HTTPS-only. Add them once you have confirmed that holds for all
# of them — not before.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.rightsclock.eu; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
